// Engine functions that the sithAIMove functions call and that the vector tests replace with stubs (shared ones of
// Libs/sith/Tests/Vec/sithVecWorld.h, the others of sithAIMoveVec.h; see Libs/sith/Tests/Vec/README.md).
//  SITHVEC_SEAM:   engine calls with side effects or tables the tests cannot reach; the capture harness patches the
//                  original function to jump to the stub
// Each name N is replaced by sithVec_N in the tested source (sithAIMoveVecTested.c, which compiles sithAIMove.c). The
// functions of sithAIMove.c itself (sithAIMove_AISetLookPos, sithAIMove_StopAIMovement, ...) run unchanged on both
// sides, as do the inline vector helpers of rdVector.h/rdMath.h and stdUtil_StrCmp.
SITHVEC_SEAM(sithCollision_FindSectorInRadius)
SITHVEC_SEAM(sithCollision_MoveThing)
